(TERRAFORMING MARS - Demo Rulebook \(Board Game Cafe\)) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(OVERVIEW) Tj T*
(Players lead corporations that make Mars habitable. Three global parameters must be) Tj T*
(raised: temperature \(from -30 to +8 degrees\), oxygen \(from 0 to 14 percent\) and oceans) Tj T*
(\(9 ocean tiles\). Each step you raise increases your Terraform Rating \(TR\) by 1. TR is) Tj T*
(both income and points.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(A GENERATION) Tj T*
(1. Player order: the first player marker passes left.) Tj T*
(2. Research: each player looks at 4 cards and buys any of them for 3 MegaCredits \(MC\)) Tj T*
(   each.) Tj T*
(3. Action phase: in turn order, each player takes 1 or 2 actions, then the next) Tj T*
(   player. A player) Tj T*
(   who passes is out until the next generation.) Tj T*
(4. Production: energy turns into heat, then every player gains resources from their) Tj T*
(   production.) Tj T*
(   MC income equals TR plus MC production.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(ACTIONS) Tj T*
(- Play a card from your hand \(pay its cost and meet its requirements\).) Tj T*
(- Use a standard project.) Tj T*
(- Claim a milestone \(8 MC; at most 3 milestones are claimed per game\).) Tj T*
(- Fund an award \(8, 14 and then 20 MC; at most 3 awards\).) Tj T*
(- Use the action of a blue card \(once per generation\).) Tj T*
(- Convert 8 plants into a greenery tile \(raises oxygen\).) Tj T*
(- Convert 8 heat to raise the temperature by one step.) Tj T*
ET
