(STANDARD PROJECTS) Tj T*
(- Sell patents: discard cards for 1 MC each.) Tj T*
(- Power plant: 11 MC for +1 energy production.) Tj T*
(- Asteroid: 14 MC to raise the temperature.) Tj T*
(- Aquifer: 18 MC to place an ocean tile.) Tj T*
(- Greenery: 23 MC to place a greenery tile.) Tj T*
(- City: 25 MC to place a city and gain +1 MC production.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(TILE PLACEMENT) Tj T*
(Placing a tile next to an ocean gives 2 MC per adjacent ocean. Greenery must be placed) Tj T*
(next to one of your tiles when possible. Cities may not be placed next to another) Tj T*
(city.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(END OF THE GAME) Tj T*
(The game ends after the generation in which all three parameters reach their maximum.) Tj T*
(Players may then convert plants into greenery one last time.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(FINAL SCORING) Tj T*
(TR + awards \(5 points first, 2 points second\) + milestones \(5 points each\) + 1 point) Tj T*
(per greenery tile + 1 point per greenery next to each of your cities + victory points) Tj T*
(on cards.) Tj T*
ET
